# Web structure (`apps/web/src/`)

- `api.ts` — the only HTTP client; every network call goes through it (`api.get/post/patch/delete` + `ApiError`)
- `providers/` — global state (auth, tenant, config)
- `pages/public/` = outside login; `pages/app/` = logged-in area (one page per file, PascalCase `XxxPage.tsx`)
- `layouts/` — AppLayout, AuthLayout, RequireAuth
- `components/ui/` — shadcn (don't hand-rewrite); `components/` — app components in kebab-case
- `lib/` — pure utility only (e.g. `cn`); no network or state
- Always import with the `@/` alias (→ `src/`)
